{"unit_id":"xiaoshihou514__dsh-vision#card-zh","repo":"xiaoshihou514/dsh-vision","commit":"d01ddc1deb46bf0b5d33a9f9400d863e6bb51d38","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 是为 DSH 增加图片理解能力的插件，接入视觉后台、图片预处理钩子和 Web 设置卡片。它可让文本模型借助 view_image 查看工作区图片，也能把对话中的图片转换为文字证据后交给模型；视觉分析可使用智谱 GLM 远程接口或本地 Qwen 模型。适合需要在 DSH 中识别截图、图片文字、图表和界面状态的用户。GLM 模式需要配置智谱 API 密钥并会发送图片，本地模式使用本机缓存的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-20","src/vision-tool.ts:77-121","src/vision-preprocessor.ts:75-164","src/qwen-backend.ts:292-303"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoshihou514__dsh-vision#card-en","repo":"xiaoshihou514/dsh-vision","commit":"d01ddc1deb46bf0b5d33a9f9400d863e6bb51d38","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision adds image understanding to DSH. The view_image tool helps text-only models inspect pictures; preprocessing converts chat images to text evidence. Use remote Zhipu GLM or local Qwen to read screenshots and charts. GLM sends images remotely and needs an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-20","src/vision-tool.ts:77-121","src/vision-preprocessor.ts:75-164","src/qwen-backend.ts:292-303"]}
